<section id="complete-module-source"><h2>Complete Lean source</h2>
<details><summary><code>AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/FunctionalInequalities/TwoPointEntropy.lean</code> — full module with imports and context</summary>
<pre class="code-block"><code class="language-lean">/-
